==Overview==
The '''Military Mutant Toilet Girl''' is a toilet unit that was added in the [[Episode 75 Update]] that can be summoned through the [[Summoning|Main Summon]].

== Appearance ==
She has 4 sharp claws to attack the toilets. Additionally, she has a plasma rifle conjoined to her lower left arm for extra fire power. She is wearing a heavy duty helmet, armor plating and a heavy duty jetpack. Obviously, she is dressed in a military uniform.

== Obtainment ==
This unit can be obtained by [[Summoning]], [[Trading]], [[Marketplace]] or it can be gifted to a player from the [[Post Office]].
