==Trivia==
*This unit is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Female_Mutant_Skibidi_Toilet Female Mutant Skibidi Toilet] from the Skibidi Toilet series.
*This unit is the first female toilet unit in the game.
*For some reason, this is stronger than [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], even though he is a Titan-sized unit.
